
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>HanuAi ML Assessment</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #243047;
      background: #f5f7fb;
    }
    main {
      background: white;
      padding: 28px;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }
    a { color: #145bd7; }
    h1 { color: #153e75; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>HanuAi Machine Learning Assessment</h1>
    <p>This project contains two assessment tasks covering
    sentiment analysis, exploratory data analysis, text mining,
    issue categorization, and clustering.</p>

    <h2>Task 1: Sentiment Analysis</h2>
    <p>A Python workflow for processing authorized product reviews,
    classifying sentiment, and identifying review aspects.</p>
    <p><a href="Task1_BestBuy_Scraping_Sentiment.ipynb">
    View Task 1 notebook</a></p>

    <h2>Task 2: Exploratory Data Analysis</h2>
    <p>Data quality checks, issue tagging, exploratory clustering,
    and analysis outputs based on the provided dataset.</p>
    <p><a href="Task2_EDA_TextMining.ipynb">
    View Task 2 notebook</a></p>

    <h2>Report and Results</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="HanuAi_ML_Assessment_Report.pdf">PDF report</a></li>
      <li><a href="HanuAi_Assignment_Outputs.xlsx">Excel results</a></li>
      <li><a href="Task2_Enriched_Events.csv">Enriched dataset</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>Note: Task 1 requires an authorized review dataset before
    actual review sentiment results can be produced.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
